istency":13.0,"_gate_incr_roic":0.04440985298904158,"_gp_incr_roic":false,"_score_incr_roic":31.5,"_gate_margin_advantage":0.06623592033292144,"_gp_margin_advantage":true,"_score_margin_advantage":55.4,"_gate_pool_share":0.9632533568846744,"_gp_pool_share":true,"_score_pool_share":100.0,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":0.0,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":0.0,"_gate_fund_growth":0,"_gp_fund_growth":false,"_score_fund_growth":0.0,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":-0.07672013785751036,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":0.0,"_gate_share_shrink":0.1775956484738166,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.010824981274744088,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":82.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.02574,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":17.2,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Ellington Financial Inc., through its subsidiary, Ellington Financial Operating Partnership LLC, acquires and manages mortgage-related, consumer-related, corporate-related, and other financial assets in the United States. It operates in two segments, Investment Portfolio and Longbridge. The company acquires and manages residential mortgage-backed securities (RMBS) backed by prime jumbo, Alt-A, non-QM, manufactured housing, subprime residential, and single-family-rental mortgage loans; RMBS for which the principal and interest payments are guaranteed by the U.S. government agency or the U.S. government-sponsored entity; residential and commercial mortgage loans; residential mortgage-backed securities; commercial mortgage-backed securities; consumer loans and asset-backed securities backed by consumer loans; investments referencing mortgage servicing rights on traditional forward mortgage loans; collateralized loan obligations; non-mortgage- and mortgage-related derivatives; debt and equity investments in loan origination companies; and other strategic investments. It also offers reverse mortgage loans, including associated financial assets, financing, hedging, and allocated expenses. The company qualifies as a real estate investment trust (REIT) for federal income tax purposes that intends to distribute at least 90% of its taxable income as dividends to shareholders. Ellington Financial Inc. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Old Greenwich, Connecticut.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Laurence Eric Penn | CEO, President & Director | Age 63","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 500 people. Revenue per employee of $673K ranks in the bottom quartile among Real Estate peers, with revenue growing 24%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $7K per employee reflects an ownership culture. Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (6/10).","financial_summary":["Ellington Financial Inc. is a small-cap real estate business with a $1.5B market cap on $336M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +78% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 8% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $925M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.3\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 7.7% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 2.6% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 1/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.1) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Payout ratio of 96% leaves essentially no coverage if earnings wobble","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (11.3% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Real Estate peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Interest-rate sensitivity and tenant-credit risk \u2014 cap rates and refinancing costs move faster than the 10-year leases can absorb.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Remote work structural vacancy \u2014 the post-pandemic shift to hybrid work has permanently impaired demand for urban office space across most markets.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 33% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Insiders are net buyers (100% buy ratio) \u2014 insiders sell for many reasons but buy for only one","Large open-market insider purchases (net $2.2M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","15 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Growing faster than most Real Estate peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Among the least levered in Real Estate \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Real Estate sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 6% over 3 months"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Ellington Financial (EFC) Stock May Be 15% Undervalued On Insider Buying","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/ellington-financial-efc-stock-may-031720575.html","date":"2026-11-21","timestamp":1795231040.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.887,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Why (EFC) Price Action Is Critical for Tactical Trading","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/22/Why_EFC_Price_Action_Is_Critical_for_Tactical_Trading_112026092401_1795227841.html","date":"2026-11-21","timestamp":1795227841.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.557,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Head-To-Head Contrast: Blackstone Mortgage Trust (NYSE:BXMT) & Ellington Financial (NYSE:EFC)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/head-to-head-contrast-blackstone-mortgage-trust-nysebxmt-ellington-financial-nyseefc.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795177736.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.96,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Ellington Financial (NYSE:EFC) Reaches New 1-Year Low \u2013 Here\u2019s Why","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/ellington-financial-nyseefc-reaches-new-1-year-low-heres-why.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795174850.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.459,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Ellington Financial (NYSE:EFC): What Is Behind Its Market Slump?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/infrastructure-and-real-estate/ellington-financial-nyseefc-what-is-behind-its-market-slump","date":"2026-11-18","timestamp":1795040400.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Ellington Financial (EFC) Stock Still Looks Reasonable After Strong Q3 Results","source":"simplywall.